Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 08:20:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 073/260] [ae-patch] Rename the sidebar's Dashboard row to
 Session Dashboard

The AE Dashboard became the Session Dashboard on 2026-10-17 (its page title
and its new read-out header). The primary navigation row follows: it reads
"Session Dashboard n/3", the session header's slots chip says "open the
Session Dashboard" to a screen reader, and the session rail's lot error
names it too; the links, the count and the active state are as before.
